oader 快照；\n- `GET /dsh-plugin-browser/catalog` 目"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"录 + 已装/加载状态合并视图；\n- `POST /dsh-plugin-browser/refresh` 清目录缓存。\n- `client/client.js`：设置页「插件浏览器」（`settin"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"gs.plugins.tab` 槽位），\n手写 CJS 零构建；动作按钮直接调用 dshmarket 的 `/dsh-market/install`、\n`/dsh-market/update`、`/d"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"sh-market/uninstall`（同源）。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"数据全部来自本机 + awesome 目录 JSON，不额外访问网络。"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## 卸载"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
